# J1 clock at 2 ppqn (Clock Ratio x2, the default): 250 ms pulses = 120 BPM,
# B2 turns blue (locked); 125 ms pulses = 240 BPM doubles the clock out;
# J2 resets. Clock gone -> back to free-run.
pot 1 0
pot 2 0
pot 3 0
pot 4 0.5
pot 6 0.5
wait 3000
clock 1 250
wait 2500
expect led b2 blue
mark
wait 2000
expect edges 7 > 6
expect edges 7 < 10
expect rms > 0.01
clock 1 125
wait 2000
mark
wait 2000
expect edges 7 > 13
pulse 2
wait 300
expect alive
clock 1 0
wait 3000
expect led b1 green
